   prompt_id: impostor_report  --  version impostor_report.glm_4_32b.v2

   Ground-up bespoke set for GLM-4-32B (a strong AGENTIC instruct model); NOT
   derived from the pinned qwen3_5_9b set. The turn is framed as an agent goal +
   action-space: a clear OBJECTIVE (protect cover, steer suspicion), the
   STRUCTURED ACTIONS available, and a SUCCESS CONDITION. The deception is the
   GAME RULE of the role (DESIGN.md §4.5), framed so a well-aligned agentic model
   plays the part without refusing or breaking character.

   Output: ONE meetings.schemas.MeetingTurn (turn_kind = "opening"); the SAME
   JSON schema every set emits (the one hard invariant, owner decision 2026-06-30).

   Inputs (loader kwargs only — observation firewall, DESIGN.md §1.3):
     agent_id, current_tick, meeting_trigger, rendered_memory, public_transcript,
     fellow_impostor_ids, living_ids, dead_ids.
